    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2140_announce_01",
      "hash64": "8D4FA18FFBF47258",
      "text": "現在只剩下\\n最後一場比賽了……\\c\\n爭奪校園最強之名的\\n最後兩位訓練家就是他們！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2140_announce_02",
      "hash64": "8D4FA48FFBF47771",
      "text": "冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]ＶＳ……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2140_announce_03",
      "hash64": "8D4FA38FFBF475BE",
      "text": "……本大賽的特別來賓，\\n首席冠軍也慈！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2140_top_01",
      "hash64": "9A17D96E1A2F590A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好，\\n冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
